          "fieldType": "Rich Text"
        }
      }
    },
    "body": {
      "jsonValue": {
        "value": "<p>For more than 125 years, Allianz Life has made promises people depend on for the rest of their lives. This is why sustainability – which focuses on planning and managing for the long term – is so fundamental to our business. For us, sustainability means not only understanding the impact of environmental, social, and governance issues on our business, but also the impact of our business on the world around us.</p>",
        "metadata": {
          "itemId": "313573d7-08dc-418e-b1f6-527ba6973180",
          "fieldId": "receipt-body",
          "fieldType": "Rich Text"
        }
      }
    },
    "heading": {
      "jsonValue": {
        "value": "Our mission – we secure your future – doesn’t stop at retirement planning.",
        "metadata": {
          "itemId": "313573d7-08dc-418e-b1f6-527ba6973180",
